            "text": "/-- The Mellin transform of a function `f` (for a complex exponent `s`), defined as the integral of\n`t ^ (s - 1) • f` over `Ioi 0`. -/\ndef mellin (f : ℝ → E) (s : ℂ) : E :=\n  ∫ t : ℝ in Ioi 0, (t : ℂ) ^ (s - 1) • f t",
